//*"SIR, GET AWAY FROM THE TEENAGERS AND PUT YOUR HANDS UP"*//

It's the police. They were a few cars over when they heard word of a drunken fart beating up on some kids. Someone ratted on you. You're gonna go to prison forever. A different, much less tranquil infinite expanse.

You hear the subway announcer through the speakers. 

//*"This is, Columbus Circle, 59th street. Transfer is available to the 2, C, B, and D trains. This is an accessible station"*//

The train stops. The crunch of the doors opening initiates.

